## psc/parse/patterns/core.pengu — patrones de `judge`/`when`.
##
## Un `when_clause` es `when <patrón> [with <payload>] [if <guarda>] -> <body>`.
## Los patrones se representan como en stage0: los literales simples quedan
## como tokens, los nombres cualificados como `when_variant`, y `maybe none`
## como un `when_variant` vacío (la forma que produce Lark).
##
## ## Memoria
## Construye nodos en el AST; no asigna strings salvo diagnósticos.

import psc.span as pspan
import psc.source as psource
import psc.token as pstoken

import psc.ast.kind as pskind
import psc.ast.node as psast
import psc.parse.state as psstate
import psc.parse.diagnostics as pdiag
import psc.parse.expr.ops as pexpr

insignia psc_parse_pattern_

## Parsea una cláusula `when ...`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea un nodo `when_clause`.
weave ppat_parse_when_clause with p as ref to PsParser into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    var ignored as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwWhen, "'when'"
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    var pattern as int is calling ppat_parse_pattern with p
    calling ps_add_child with p, pattern
    if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwWith:
        calling ps_add_child with p, (calling ppat_parse_payload with p)
    else:
        calling ps_add_absent with p
    if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwIf:
        calling ps_add_child with p, (calling ppat_parse_guard with p)
    else if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwWhen:
        calling ps_add_child with p, (calling ppat_parse_guard with p)
    else:
        calling ps_add_absent with p
    var ignored2 as Token is calling ps_expect with p, TokArrow, "'->'"
    var fn as ref to weave with p as ref to PsParser into int is p->hooks.when_body
    var body as int is calling fn with p
    calling ps_add_child with p, body
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdWhenClause, start, (calling pexpr.pexpr_end_of with p, body), 0

## Parsea un patrón completo, con alternativas `|`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea un nodo `when_pattern`.
weave ppat_parse_pattern with p as ref to PsParser into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    calling ppat_add_variant with p
    var more as bool is true
    while more:
        if calling ps_check with p, TokVerticalBar:
            calling ps_add_token with p, p->pos
            var ignored as Token is calling ps_advance with p
            calling ppat_add_variant with p
        else:
            set more is false
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdWhenPattern, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0

## Añade una variante al patrón en construcción.
##
## ## Memoria
## Añade un token o un nodo `when_variant`.
weave ppat_add_variant with p as ref to PsParser into void:
    var k as TokenKind is calling ps_kind_at with p
    if k == TokIntLit or k == TokFloatLit or k == TokStringLit or k == TokCharLit:
        calling ps_add_token with p, p->pos
        var ignored as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        return
    if k == TokKeyword:
        if (calling ps_check_kw with p, KwTrue) or (calling ps_check_kw with p, KwFalse):
            var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
            if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwTrue:
                var ignored2 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
                calling ps_add_child with p, (calling ppat_finish_empty with p, NodeKind.NdTrueLit, start)
            else:
                var ignored3 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
                calling ps_add_child with p, (calling ppat_finish_empty with p, NodeKind.NdFalseLit, start)
            return
        if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwMaybe:
            var start2 as int is calling ps_current_start with p
            var ignored4 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
            var ignored5 as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwNone, "'none'"
            calling ps_add_child with p, (calling ppat_finish_empty with p, NodeKind.NdWhenVariant, start2)
            return
    if calling ps_check_name_like with p:
        var start3 as int is calling ps_current_start with p
        if (calling ps_kind_ahead with p, 1) == TokDot:
            calling ps_begin_children with p
            calling ps_add_name_like with p
            var more as bool is true
            while more:
                if calling ps_check with p, TokDot:
                    var ignored7 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
                    if calling ps_check_name_like with p:
                        calling ps_add_name_like with p
                    else:
                        calling ps_emit_here with p, pdiag.ParseIssue.ParseExpectedName, ""
                        set more is false
                else:
                    set more is false
            var variant as int is calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdWhenVariant, start3, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0
            calling ps_add_child with p, variant
        else:
            calling ps_add_name_like with p
        return
    calling ps_emit_here with p, pdiag.ParseIssue.ParseInvalidWhenClause, ""
    var err as int is calling ps_error_node with p, (calling ps_current_start with p), (calling ps_current_start with p)
    calling ps_add_child with p, err

## Cierra un nodo vacío en `start`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea un nodo sin hijos.
weave ppat_finish_empty with p as ref to PsParser, kind as NodeKind, start as int into int:
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, kind, start, start, 0

## Parsea `with field, field...`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea un nodo `when_payload`.
weave ppat_parse_payload with p as ref to PsParser into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    var ignored as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwWith, "'with'"
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    var more as bool is true
    while more:
        var field as int is calling ppat_parse_when_field with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, field
        if calling ps_check with p, TokComma:
            var ignored2 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        else if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwAnd:
            var ignored3 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        else:
            set more is false
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdWhenPayload, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0

## Parsea `NAME [as pattern]`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea un nodo `when_field`.
weave ppat_parse_when_field with p as ref to PsParser into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    calling ps_add_name_like with p
    if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwAs:
        var ignored2 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, (calling ppat_parse_field_pattern with p)
    else:
        calling ps_add_absent with p
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdWhenField, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0

## Parsea un patrón de campo: tupla o estado cualificado.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea `field_tuple` o `field_pattern`.
weave ppat_parse_field_pattern with p as ref to PsParser into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    if calling ps_check with p, TokLeftParen:
        var ignored as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        calling ps_begin_children with p
        var more as bool is true
        while more:
            calling ps_add_name_like with p
            if calling ps_check with p, TokComma:
                var ignored3 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
            else:
                set more is false
        var ignored4 as Token is calling ps_expect with p, TokRightParen, "')'"
        var tuple as int is calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdFieldTuple, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0
        calling ps_begin_children with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, tuple
        return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdFieldPattern, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    calling ps_add_name_like with p
    var more2 as bool is true
    while more2:
        if calling ps_check with p, TokDot:
            var ignored6 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
            if calling ps_check_name_like with p:
                calling ps_add_name_like with p
            else:
                calling ps_emit_here with p, pdiag.ParseIssue.ParseExpectedName, ""
                set more2 is false
        else:
            set more2 is false
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdFieldPattern, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0

## Parsea una guarda `if expr` / `when expr`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea un nodo `when_guard`.
weave ppat_parse_guard with p as ref to PsParser into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    var ignored as Token is calling ps_advance with p
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    var cond as int is calling pexpr.pexpr_parse_guard_expr with p
    calling ps_add_child with p, cond
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdWhenGuard, start, (calling pexpr.pexpr_end_of with p, cond), 0
